e_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"329844f5-ff3f-4b35-98cc-5cc7d172f924","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"なるほど。自分にはここまでは絞り込めないなぁ・・・","ts":"1637308543.392200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j9K3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f42b9d57-b321-4588-8e66-fb726c9eac76","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これだけなので、遅延ロードなしでもこの速度になった感じです","ts":"1637308457.391300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"phGct"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed1b65f1-0124-4865-be0c-c19c419188b7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"色々考えたけど、結局必要なプラグインはこれだけになりました\n``` call minpac#init()\n call minpac#add('mattn/emmet-vim')\n call minpac#add('mattn/vim-lexiv')\n call minpac#add('mattn/vim-molder')\n call minpac#add('cocopon/iceberg.vim')\n call minpac#add('prabirshrestha/vim-lsp')\n call minpac#add('mattn/vim-lsp-settings')\n call minpac#add('prabirshrestha/asyncomplete.vim')\n call minpac#add('prabirshrestha/asyncomplete-lsp.vim')\n call minpac#add('k-takata/minpac',{'type':'opt'})```","ts":"1637308431.390700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LJ/0l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a0a4827-0da7-46ee-ac56-25de1a8c03ba","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ですです","ts":"1637308345.389500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yO9/2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8029f0c2-9488-4758-88b5-38c6d57201ea","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"minpac ということは遅延ロードなしでこの速度ってことですか?","ts":"1637308297.389300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BkSw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e0a3e72-77b2-4e50-bb77-92d345cf4c12"